{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-11-29 13:00:00', 'title': 'CALICHE DEVELOPMENT PARTNERS II ANNOUNCES ITS FIRST ACQUISITIONS FOLLOWING $268 MILLION CAPITAL COMMITMENT FROM ORION INFRASTRUCTURE CAPITAL AND GCM GROSVENOR', 'text': "— CALICHE'S UNDERGROUND STORAGE PLATFORM TO SUPPORT ENERGY SECURITY AND TRANSITION — — PARTNERSHIP CLOSES FIRST ACQUISITION OF GOLDEN TRIANGLE STORAGE AND ANNOUNCES PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF CENTRAL VALLEY GAS STORAGE — HOUSTON\xa0, NOV. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CALICHE DEVELOPMENT PARTNERS II (CALICHE OR CALICHE II), ORION INFRASTRUCTURE CAPITAL (OIC), AND GCM GROSVENOR (NASDAQ: GCMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEIR PARTNERSHIP TARGETING UNDERGROUND STORAGE AND SEQUESTRATION ASSETS IN NORTH AMERICA.\xa0 THE CAPITAL COMMITMENTS REPRESENT OIC'S SECOND INVESTMENT WITH THE CALICHE MANAGEMENT TEAM, AND CALICHE'S FIRST WITH OIC'S FREQUENT INVESTMENT PARTNER GCM GROSVENOR, WHICH INVESTED CLIENT CAPITAL."}